    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's financials, active project budgets, daily rates, overhead, cash position, tender eligibility thresholds, and cost sensitivity parameters as of 2024, what is our company's projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our company's can propose? our company's target gross margin percentage is 28 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to determine our projected margin on this contract, I would need more specific information about the project scope, required resources, and required resources associated costs, which is not provided in our company's context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, our company's maximum contract value eligibility threshold of 3 million euros is met, and our company's can potentially bid for this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, based on our company's cost sensitivity parameters, if a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years were to be reduced by 10 percent, our company's could absorb reduced via rate renegotiation with subcontractors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "If a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years were reduced by 20 percent, our company's would need to reduce the scope of the project, such as removing optional modules or reducing training days." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Any further reduction would likely make the project not viable without a fundamental change in scope.  our company's standard pricing model includes margins for infrastructure and software licence resale, which could be optimized based on the specific requirements of this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed information about the project, it's difficult to propose specific cost-optimization strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that uses artificial intelligence to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, with functionalities such as assistance with consultation of information, drafting of administrative contents, instruction of files, and collaboration and continuity of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, what is the proposed AI solution for this project? the proposed AI solution for this project's expertise in large language models, specifically our company's preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and complies with EU regulations.  our company's would fine-tune our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and complies with EU regulations using our company's established methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to adapt our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and complies with EU regulations to the specific tone, format, and domain knowledge required for municipal administrative tasks. adapt is expected to yield an average accuracy gain of 12% compared to a non-fine-tuned model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To enhance information retrieval and consultation capabilities, our company's would integrate Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) techniques, utilizing our company's experience with vector stores like Qdrant or Weaviate. integrate would enable our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and complies with EU regulations to provide more accurate and relevant information to municipal agents by retrieving from a knowledge base of administrative documents and regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting administrative contents and instructing files, our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and complies with EU regulations would generate high-quality text based on the input prompts and context provided by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Collaboration and continuity of processing would be facilitated through a user interface that allows agents to interact with the AI system seamlessly, providing feedback and corrections that could further improve our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and complies with EU regulations performance over time." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Explainability and trust are crucial in this application, so our company's would implement source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, and confidence scoring." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Actions for low-confidence outputs would include displaying uncertainty warnings and escalating to human supervisors, ensuring transparency and reliability in the decision-making process. the proposed AI solution for this project aligns with our company's past successes in delivering AI-powered assistants for regulatory document Q&A, contract review, clinical guideline assistance, and data synthesis for urban planners, demonstrating our company's capability to adapt AI technologies to various domains and use cases." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By addressing known trade-offs such as explicability vs. performance and model size vs. energy consumption, our company's can provide a balanced solution that meets both the functional requirements of municipal agents and the compliance standards of the EU AI Act." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information, with a solution that relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact and contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, what is the proposed sustainability plan for this project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at our company's, the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. propose a sustainability plan that leverages our company's existing capabilities to minimize environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's Silver EcoVadis rating and ongoing efforts to improve, our company's will utilize our company's green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, who both use 100% renewable energy.  our company's digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, will be implemented to reduce energy consumption by an estimated 35% compared to our company's baseline. our company's will also ensure transparency in our company's carbon reporting, following the GRI Standards (partial), and manage electronic waste through our company's partnership with Ecologic, a certified WEEE recycling facility in France." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address potential sustainability trade-offs, our company's have standard resolutions in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, to balance high availability with energy efficiency, our company's will use low-power standby modes that allow for wake-up times under 90 seconds, which is compatible with our company's SLA requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "When dealing with on-premise servers, our company's recommend clients subscribe to renewable energy Guarantee of Origin certificates to ensure the energy used is from renewable sources." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, in balancing performance with model size, our company's prefer quantised mid-size models (7B–13B) with fine-tuning over larger, unoptimised models to reduce energy consumption without compromising accuracy significantly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these measures and continuously monitoring our company's carbon footprint, which was 148 tCO2e for Scope 1 and 2 as of the last bilan carbone in 2023, our company's aim to contribute to reducing energetic consumption and lowering the environmental impact of the client's information systems. our company's goal aligns with our company's net-zero target by 2040, ensuring a sustainable future for our company's operations and the projects our company's undertake." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with potential partners such as EuroCloud Solutions S.A., LexIA GmbH, and GreenCompute S.r.l., proposes a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, enhancing efficiency and quality of service rendered to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. approach is grounded in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT. a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, enhancing efficiency and quality of service rendered to users will cover four primary functionalities: assistance with the consultation of information, drafting of administrative contents, instruction of files, and collaboration and continuity of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve a response time of less than 2 seconds, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will utilize fine-tuning methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to optimize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and complies with EU regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will deploy a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, enhancing efficiency and quality of service rendered to users on a cloud provider with a proven track record, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, utilizing a cloud provider with a proven track record, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway EU regions and ensuring auto-scaling capabilities to handle varying workloads." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
