        ex:hasText "Given The client requirements and our company's context, the primary legal risks to monitor include open-source licence compliance, ensuring that all automated decisions have human validation in line with EU AI Act, and maintaining the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance.  our company's standard IP model of work-for-hire, where all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment, should mitigate potential intellectual property disputes. our company's insurance coverage, including professional indemnity, cyber liability, and performance bond capacity, provides a level of security against potential liabilities." ;
